{"Direct dict access `integration.metadata[\"sender\"][\"login\"]` will raise KeyError if the integration was created without sender info, since the sender key is only conditionally set. Should use `.get()` with safe fallback like `integration.metadata.get('sender', {}).get('login')` and handle the None case": 0.9516029953956604, "get_user_info() calls resp.raise_for_status() internally which raises HTTPError on non-2xx responses, but this is not caught, causing unhandled 500 errors instead of showing graceful error page. Should wrap in try/except and return error(request, self.active_organization) on failure": 0.9373379945755005, "OAuth redirect_uri is built via f-string concatenation without percent-encoding, but the value contains :// and / characters that should be encoded per RFC 3986. Should use urllib.parse.urlencode to build the query string": 0.8591540455818176}